### Fetch settings
GET {{baseApiPath}}/statistics/settings

### Fetch data
GET {{baseApiPath}}/statistics/data?fromDate=2000-01-01&toDate=2999-12-31

### Generate CSV export
GET {{baseApiPath}}/statistics/generate-csv?fromDate=2000-01-01&toDate=2999-12-31

### Fetch children report data
GET {{baseApiPath}}/statistics/children?ageMin=6&ageMax=15

### Fetch children report data for a reference date (age as of that day)
GET {{baseApiPath}}/statistics/children?ageMin=6&ageMax=15&referenceDate=2999-09-01

### Fetch children count per age year
GET {{baseApiPath}}/statistics/children/age-distribution?ageMin=6&ageMax=15

### Generate children report CSV export
GET {{baseApiPath}}/statistics/generate-children-csv?ageMin=6&ageMax=15
